<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62294" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειτουργ-ός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λήϊτος, ἔργον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who performed a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειτουργία</span> (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				82.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. τῶν</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν παισὶ λειτουργιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					2881.13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2882
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2886
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Branchidae</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>public servant</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ στάσις τῶν λ.
				[τοῦ Σαλομῶνος</span>] <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				10.5
			</span></i>; of <i>workmen, carpenters</i>, etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκοδόμοι καὶ λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					3p.139
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.93.5
			</span></i>; at Magnesia, an official of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γερουσία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Magn.</u>
				116.17
			</span></i>; = Lat.<i>lictor</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Rom.</u>
				26
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. τῆς χρείας μου</span>
			<i>ministering</i> to my need, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Phil.</u>
				2.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>private servant</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ki.</u>
				13.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in
			religioussense, <i>minister</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοῦ</span>] ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ps.</u>
				102(103).21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				13.6
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					2.22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				73
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἁγίων λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
					8.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοῖς λιτουργοί</span> (sic) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Et.Anc.</u>
				32.5
			</span></i> (Athens, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>); <i>attendant</i> at
			sacrifices, <i>acolyte,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				3.1005
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> Astrol.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειτουργοί, οἱ</span>, astral gods <i>subordinate</i> to the
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκανοί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				9.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Firm.
				2.4.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Mart.Cap.
				2.200
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
